{"item": "e023", "oracle_pass": false, "evidence": "checker: Rule judge for NUM with 5% relative tolerance: parsed model=[5.0, 5.0, 5.0], reference=[40.0, 40.0, 40.0]; mismatches: #1: 5.0 != 40.0 (relative error 0.875), #2: 5.0 != 40.0 (relative error 0.875), #3: 5.0 != 40.0 (relative error 0.875) ", "skill_hash": "b961a3b32351", "truth_source": "checker", "skill_result": "(5,\\ 5,\\ 5)\\ \\mu_B", "failure_reason": "题面问的是「a unit cell」的磁矩，应按尖晶石单胞含 Z=8 个化学式单元来换算（单胞矩 = 每式单元矩 × 8）；该解答错把「每化学式单元的净矩」直接当作「单胞矩」，漏乘了 Z=8，导致三个值都按 per formula unit 给出而非 per unit cell。判据上，凡题面出现 \"unit cell\" 而非 \"per formula unit / per molecule\" 时，必须先确认尖晶石结构的 Z 再缩放，不能把亚晶格相消后的 per-formula-unit 净矩直接当作单胞矩。"}
